ns You’ll Love</h3>\r\n        <p class=\"crochet-card__description\">\r\n            Explore our brand-new collection of meticulously handcrafted bouquet crochet pieces, each one carefully designed to bring a touch of artistry and elegance to any space.\r\n        </p>\r\n        <a href=\"/flowers/\" class=\"crochet-card__button button button--primary\">Shop now</a>\r\n        <div class=\"crochet-card__image-container\">\r\n            <img src=\"{{cdn 'assets/img/T&C/card2img.png'}}\" alt=\"Icon\" class=\"crochet-card__image\" />\r\n            <img src=\"{{cdn 'assets/img/T&C/card2decor.svg'}}\" class=\"crochet-card__decor crochet-card__decor--swirl-medium\" alt=\"Decor\" />\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n  \r\n      <!-- Card 3 -->\r\n      <div class=\"crochet-card crochet-card--small alt-layout\">\r\n        <p class=\"crochet-card__subheading\">Summer Sale – 15% Off</p>\r\n        <h3 class=\"crochet-card__heading\">Snag Your Favorite Crochet Pieces at 15% Off</h3>\r\n        <p class=\"crochet-card__description\">\r\n            Take advantage of a limited-time offer and enjoy 15% off on all crochet products this summer! Whether you're treating yourself or searching for the perfect handmade gift.\r\n        </p>\r\n        <a href=\"/flowers/\" class=\"crochet-card__button button button--primary\">Shop now</a>\r\n        <img src=\"{{cdn 'assets/img/T&C/landingpng.png'}}\" alt=\"\" class=\"crochet-card__image\" />\r\n        <img src=\"{{cdn 'assets/img/T&C/card3decor.svg'}}\" class=\"crochet-card__decor crochet-card__decor--blob-small\" alt=\"Decor\" />\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  "
